Description: resource definition: convert legacy comment markers
 The bundled resource definition comments out eleven unused resource
 entries with legacy "#" comment markers. The V\OS resource compiler
 accepts "//" and "/* */" comments only, so rc stops with a syntax
 error at the first of those lines and drops every later resource.
Author: Numerio <b.vitruvio@gmail.com>
Forwarded: no
Origin: https://github.com/HaikuArchives/BePDF

